+<!-- advc.008c: clarified -->
+<TEXT>
+	<Tag>TXT_KEY_HINT_INTERFACE_10</Tag>
+	<English>You can load units into a transport in a coastal water tile by ordering the units to move into that tile. A transport in a city tile will have to be loaded through the [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]Load[COLOR_REVERT] command.</English>
