+<TEXT>
+	<Tag>TXT_KEY_HINT_INTERFACE_11</Tag>
+	<English>You can unload units from a transport by ordering the transport to move onto a land tile without a city. To unload in a city, you'll have to use the [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]Unload[COLOR_REVERT] command.</English>
