+<TEXT>
+	<Tag>TXT_KEY_HINT_INTERFACE_38</Tag>
+	<English>Unloading units in friendly cities or forts doesn't cost any movement points. Even if your transport needs to use one or two extra movement points to enter a city, the movement points saved by the units in cargo are often more valuable.</English>
