+	<English>When more than one of your cities is able to work a tile, the game assigns that tile to the closest city. You can override this by opening the screen of another city and left-clicking the tile. Right-click the tile to undo the assignment.</English>
+	<French>When more than one of your cities is able to work a tile, the game assigns that tile to the closest city. You can override this by opening the screen of another city and left-clicking the tile. Right-click the tile to undo the assignment.</French>
+	<German>Wenn mehrere Ihrer St�dte dasselbe Gel�ndefeld bearbeiten k�nnen, wird das Feld automatisch der n�chstgelegenen Stadt zugewiesen. Um das Feld manuell einer anderen Stadt zuzuweisen, �ffnen Sie den Bildschirm dieser Stadt und klicken Sie dort auf das Feld. Mit einem Rechtsklick k�nnen Sie die Zuweisung wieder zur�cknehmen.</German>
+	<Italian>When more than one of your cities is able to work a tile, the game assigns that tile to the closest city. You can override this by opening the screen of another city and left-clicking the tile. Right-click the tile to undo the assignment.</Italian>
